  "mb": 2.35,
  "deviation": "Manifest asks for 1280x720 third-person RGB; delivered 640x360. 1280x720 is RH20T's ORIGINAL capture resolution and is not distributed anywhere reachable: the official RH20T_color release was downsampled by the authors to 320x180, and 640x360 (this LeRobot port) is the highest-resolution RH20T RGB obtainable without a >30 GB tar. Verified genuine 640x360, not an upscale (640->320->640 roundtrip PSNR 29.9 dB, Laplacian variance 718). Also a user substitution: manifest says 'any user', so user_0005 was picked as the highest-rated (9/10) run of task_0016 scene_0001 in cfg1."
